46.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.3390/polym12040846"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="pmcid" xlink:href="PMC7240466"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="pmid" xlink:href="32272605"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=Polymers&amp;title=Fatigue Life Assessment of Filled Rubber by Hysteresis Induced Self-heating Temperature&amp;author=W. Luo&amp;author=Y. Huang&amp;author=B. Yin&amp;author=X. Xiang&amp;author=X. Hu&amp;volume=12&amp;publication_year=2020&amp;pages=846&amp;pmid=32272605&amp;doi=10.3390/polym12040846&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B19-polymers-17-03091"><label>19.</label><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Merckel Y., Diani J., Brieu M., Caillard J. Constitutive Modeling of the Anisotropic Behavior of Mullins Softened Filled Rubbers. Mech. Mater. 2013;57:30–41. doi: 10.1016/j.mechmat.2012.10.010.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1016/j.mechmat.2012.10.010"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=Mech. Mater.&amp;title=Constitutive Modeling of the Anisotropic Behavior of Mullins Softened Filled Rubbers&amp;author=Y. Merckel&amp;author=J. Diani&amp;author=M. Brieu&amp;author=J. Caillard&amp;volume=57&amp;publication_year=2013&amp;pages=30-41&amp;doi=10.1016/j.mechmat.2012.10.010&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B20-polymers-17-03091"><label>20.</label><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Park D.M., Hong W.H., Kim S.G., Kim H.J. Heat Generation of Filled Rubber Vulcanizates and its Relationship with Vulcanizate Network Structures. Eur. Polym. J. 2000;36:2429–2436. doi: 10.1016/S0014-3057(00)00020-3.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.o